Notes on this fork

This repository is a fork of https://github.com/codalio/codalio-blueprint and
contains two bodies of work, both under the MIT License above.

1. Upstream codalio-blueprint, Copyright (c) 2026 Codalio: the planning skill
   sources under skills/, the sample outputs under examples/, and the vendor
   plugin manifests (.claude-plugin/, .cursor-plugin/, .codex-plugin/,
   .antigravity-plugin/, gemini-extension.json). Codalio's copyright and
   permission notice is reproduced verbatim and unmodified above, as the MIT
   License requires for all copies and substantial portions of the Software.

2. The SimpleRAG plug-in added by this fork, Copyright (c) 2026 Michael Anthony
   Falabella: the Blueprint page, tabbed workspace, agent runtime, file
   previewer, installer, stylesheet and tests under src/, tests/ and tools/.

   src/skills.js is an original executable port of the upstream skills. The
   methodology, lens prompts, process flows, output contracts, document
   templates and output paths it encodes are Codalio's and remain under
   Codalio's copyright; the port's expression is this fork's.

Neither body of work depends on the other at runtime. See README.md for which
half of the tree does what, and for how to pull upstream changes.
